# Drum-kit audio is a LOCAL asset, not committed.
#
# Licensing varies and many "free" sample sets (e.g. LANDR free samples) are
# royalty-free for use in productions but NOT redistributable in a source repo.
# So we keep the audio binaries out of git. Place your licensed kit one-shots
# (kick.wav / snare.wav / hat.wav / crash.wav) in default/ locally — see
# SAMPLE_SOURCES.md. The percussion layer no-ops gracefully when they're absent.
*.wav
*.mp3
*.aif
*.aiff
*.flac
*.ogg
